    "Folders to be moved to the Trash (%@ total):\n%@\n\nThey contain %@’s settings, sign-in data and session history. After deleting, you’ll need to sign in again and past sessions will be gone. Make sure you no longer need them.\n\nThey can be restored until you empty the Trash.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以下文件夹会移到废纸篓（共 %1$@）：\n%2$@\n\n里面有 %3$@ 的设置、登录信息和会话记录。删除后需要重新登录，历史会话也会消失。请自己确认不再需要它们。\n\n清倒废纸篓之前都能恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
