    "The app couldn’t be moved to the Trash, so nothing else was removed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App 本体无法移到废纸篓，所以没有动其他任何文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app is running. Quit it and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App 正在运行，退出后再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The command could not start": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "命令无法启动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first time Peek looks at your Downloads folder, or empties the Trash, macOS asks you to allow it. Saying no only turns that one feature off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "第一次查看“下载”文件夹或清空废纸篓时，macOS 会请你授权。拒绝只会让对应的那一项功能不可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These items are caches and logs that apps rebuild by themselves.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些是缓存和日志，应用会自己重新生成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This folder can’t be read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此文件夹无法读取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This permanently deletes everything in the Trash. It can’t be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "废纸篓里的所有内容会被永久删除，无法恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tool not installed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工具未安装"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Top processes": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高占用进程"
          }
        }
      }
